File Index: 104 of 109
Audio ID: 7172876809816640802
Audio Duration: 9m 24.7s (564.66s)
Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 14:37:00 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 0.99)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,640] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 12 | Text: 这个世界的规则永远都是强者定的
Segment #2   [00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:04,500] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 10 | Text: 其他的人只能顺从并适应
Segment #3   [00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:05,300] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 4  | Text: 只能垫头
Segment #4   [00:00:05,940 --> 00:00:07,240] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 8  | Text: 说个能垫腹三观的
Segment #5   [00:00:07,780 --> 00:00:09,640] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 10 | Text: 凡是能够实现财务自由的
Segment #6   [00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:10,540] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 4  | Text: 都有一个特点
Segment #7   [00:00:10,540 --> 00:00:12,000] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 6  | Text: 那就是做装思维
Segment #8   [00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:14,200] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 9  | Text: 同样都是从底层生活过的人
Segment #9   [00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:15,900] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 5  | Text: 为什么他能翻身
Segment #10  [00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:18,280] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 9  | Text: 而我而你我们只能观望
Segment #11  [00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:20,600] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 10 | Text: 你能够把这条内容看完
Segment #12  [00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:23,240] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 14 | Text: 能够让你更清楚地看待这个世界的本质
Segment #13  [00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:24,800] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 8  | Text: 对于创业没兴趣的人
Segment #14  [00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:25,460] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 3  | Text: 你可以滑走了
Segment #15  [00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:26,640] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 7  | Text: 不想耽误你的时间啊
Segment #16  [00:00:26,640 --> 00:00:27,580] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 4  | Text: 废话不多说
Segment #17  [00:00:27,580 --> 00:00:28,380] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 4  | Text: 我们开始动脑
Segment #18  [00:00:28,840 --> 00:00:31,300] | Elapsed:  30.20s | Words: 8  | Text: 首先我们要分清一个概念
Segment #19  [00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:34,560] | Elapsed:  30.20s | Words: 11 | Text: 就是做装和做装是有差别的
Segment #20  [00:00:34,560 --> 00:00:36,980] | Elapsed:  30.20s | Words: 14 | Text: 做装是一种动态调整的博弈思维
Segment #21  [00:00:36,980 --> 00:00:39,560] | Elapsed:  30.20s | Words: 11 | Text: 而做装是静态的优势地位
Segment #22  [00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:41,420] | Elapsed:  30.20s | Words: 8  | Text: 说白了前者是翻身
Segment #23  [00:00:41,420 --> 00:00:42,520] | Elapsed:  30.20s | Words: 4  | Text: 底层翻身
Segment #24  [00:00:42,520 --> 00:00:44,260] | Elapsed:  30.20s | Words: 10 | Text: 后者是优越家庭的继承
Segment #25  [00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:46,880] | Elapsed:  30.20s | Words: 9  | Text: 身居高位的人都懂一个事
Segment #26  [00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:48,440] | Elapsed:  30.20s | Words: 9  | Text: 那就是在这个社会上生存
Segment #27  [00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:50,680] | Elapsed:  30.20s | Words: 8  | Text: 不是做装的事就不干
Segment #28  [00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:51,400] | Elapsed:  30.20s | Words: 4  | Text: 或者说少干
Segment #29  [00:00:51,980 --> 00:00:52,840] | Elapsed:  30.20s | Words: 5  | Text: 因为只有你做装
Segment #30  [00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:53,740] | Elapsed:  30.20s | Words: 6  | Text: 你才能说了算
Segment #31  [00:00:53,740 --> 00:00:55,820] | Elapsed:  30.20s | Words: 12 | Text: 因为在别人制定的游戏规则里
Segment #32  [00:00:55,820 --> 00:00:58,280] | Elapsed:  47.04s | Words: 11 | Text: 在别人制定的世界的规则里
Segment #33  [00:00:58,280 --> 00:01:00,160] | Elapsed:  47.04s | Words: 10 | Text: 你生存的概率几乎为0
Segment #34  [00:01:00,160 --> 00:01:01,980] | Elapsed:  47.04s | Words: 8  | Text: 更别人说什么发展了
Segment #35  [00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:03,840] | Elapsed:  47.04s | Words: 7  | Text: 为什么一个人永远赚不了
Segment #36  [00:01:03,840 --> 00:01:05,000] | Elapsed:  47.04s | Words: 6  | Text: 认知以外的钱
Segment #37  [00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:06,260] | Elapsed:  47.04s | Words: 7  | Text: 是因为你认知以外
Segment #38  [00:01:06,260 --> 00:01:07,060] | Elapsed:  47.04s | Words: 5  | Text: 都是别人的局
Segment #39  [00:01:07,060 --> 00:01:07,700] | Elapsed:  47.04s | Words: 4  | Text: 别人的装
Segment #40  [00:01:08,100 --> 00:01:09,860] | Elapsed:  47.04s | Words: 6  | Text: 你只是别人手里
Segment #41  [00:01:09,860 --> 00:01:11,380] | Elapsed:  47.04s | Words: 7  | Text: 手拿把掐的玩物
Segment #42  [00:01:12,300 --> 00:01:13,680] | Elapsed:  47.04s | Words: 8  | Text: 认知这个东西说白了
Segment #43  [00:01:13,680 --> 00:01:14,740] | Elapsed:  47.04s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是吃亏吃多了
Segment #44  [00:01:14,740 --> 00:01:15,800] | Elapsed:  47.04s | Words: 5  | Text: 拿钱打出来的
Segment #45  [00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:17,680] | Elapsed:  47.04s | Words: 9  | Text: 但是你要永远记住一句话
Segment #46  [00:01:17,680 --> 00:01:20,280] | Elapsed:  47.04s | Words: 11 | Text: 钱买的教学才是最深刻的
Segment #47  [00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:21,880] | Elapsed:  47.04s | Words: 9  | Text: 所以说做装思维是一种
Segment #48  [00:01:21,880 --> 00:01:24,940] | Elapsed:  47.04s | Words: 13 | Text: 可以将人生生存哲学和发展哲学
Segment #49  [00:01:24,940 --> 00:01:26,560] | Elapsed:  63.12s | Words: 9  | Text: 统一起来的致胜之道
Segment #50  [00:01:26,560 --> 00:01:27,540] | Elapsed:  63.12s | Words: 4  | Text: 通过做装
Segment #51  [00:01:27,540 --> 00:01:30,200] | Elapsed:  63.12s | Words: 17 | Text: 你才能在各种的博弈当中活得优势地位
Segment #52  [00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:32,540] | Elapsed:  63.12s | Words: 6  | Text: 从而减少或者说
Segment #53  [00:01:33,040 --> 00:01:34,600] | Elapsed:  63.12s | Words: 7  | Text: 转移自己的风险吧
Segment #54  [00:01:34,600 --> 00:01:36,720] | Elapsed:  63.12s | Words: 11 | Text: 只有经过了这一系列的操作
Segment #55  [00:01:36,720 --> 00:01:37,800] | Elapsed:  63.12s | Words: 6  | Text: 你的投入产出比
Segment #56  [00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:39,220] | Elapsed:  63.12s | Words: 8  | Text: 才能实现第一最大化
Segment #57  [00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:41,860] | Elapsed:  63.12s | Words: 6  | Text: 不知道你没有没有发现
Segment #58  [00:01:41,860 --> 00:01:43,640] | Elapsed:  63.12s | Words: 10 | Text: 反正我感觉这个世界的构造
Segment #59  [00:01:43,640 --> 00:01:44,380] | Elapsed:  63.12s | Words: 4  | Text: 其实很简单
Segment #60  [00:01:44,380 --> 00:01:46,840] | Elapsed:  63.12s | Words: 12 | Text: 首先你要对于财富有一个正确的人质
Segment #61  [00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:48,940] | Elapsed:  63.12s | Words: 7  | Text: 之前也发视频聊过
Segment #62  [00:01:48,940 --> 00:01:50,540] | Elapsed:  63.12s | Words: 7  | Text: 我不知道发第二次能不能活
Segment #63  [00:01:50,540 --> 00:01:52,540] | Elapsed:  63.12s | Words: 8  | Text: 财富自由最快的方式
Segment #64  [00:01:52,540 --> 00:01:54,860] | Elapsed:  80.89s | Words: 11 | Text: 不是财富创造而是财富专业
Segment #65  [00:01:54,860 --> 00:01:56,760] | Elapsed:  80.89s | Words: 12 | Text: 而做装就是在这种游戏规则里
Segment #66  [00:01:56,760 --> 00:01:59,500] | Elapsed:  80.89s | Words: 12 | Text: 能实现财富专业最快的方式
Segment #67  [00:01:59,500 --> 00:02:01,660] | Elapsed:  80.89s | Words: 11 | Text: 这个做装从某种程度上来讲
Segment #68  [00:02:02,160 --> 00:02:03,540] | Elapsed:  80.89s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是合法的强和片
Segment #69  [00:02:03,900 --> 00:02:06,140] | Elapsed:  80.89s | Words: 15 | Text: 你像电影《让子弹飞》那句话一样
Segment #70  [00:02:06,140 --> 00:02:07,680] | Elapsed:  80.89s | Words: 8  | Text: 豪声的钱如竖风环
Segment #71  [00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:09,380] | Elapsed:  80.89s | Words: 8  | Text: 韭菜的钱三七分成
Segment #72  [00:02:09,720 --> 00:02:10,600] | Elapsed:  80.89s | Words: 5  | Text: 被割的韭菜
Segment #73  [00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:11,720] | Elapsed:  80.89s | Words: 7  | Text: 你只能双手抱头
Segment #74  [00:02:11,720 --> 00:02:12,480] | Elapsed:  80.89s | Words: 5  | Text: 一点办法都没有
Segment #75  [00:02:12,980 --> 00:02:14,080] | Elapsed:  80.89s | Words: 6  | Text: 而对于做装的人
Segment #76  [00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:15,900] | Elapsed:  80.89s | Words: 10 | Text: 这完全是在规则范围之内
Segment #77  [00:02:15,900 --> 00:02:16,780] | Elapsed:  80.89s | Words: 4  | Text: 随便玩的
Segment #78  [00:02:17,500 --> 00:02:19,340] | Elapsed:  80.89s | Words: 9  | Text: 为什么现在的钱越来越难赚
Segment #79  [00:02:19,340 --> 00:02:20,620] | Elapsed:  80.89s | Words: 5  | Text: 本质上就是因为
Segment #80  [00:02:20,620 --> 00:02:21,920] | Elapsed:  97.78s | Words: 8  | Text: 阶层固化太严重的
Segment #81  [00:02:21,920 --> 00:02:24,080] | Elapsed:  97.78s | Words: 10 | Text: 所有的东西都已经被设计好了
Segment #82  [00:02:24,620 --> 00:02:25,480] | Elapsed:  97.78s | Words: 2  | Text: 对不对
Segment #83  [00:02:25,480 --> 00:02:27,400] | Elapsed:  97.78s | Words: 11 | Text: 我做过连锁的汽车副门店
Segment #84  [00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:29,920] | Elapsed:  97.78s | Words: 8  | Text: 我当时最大的一个失误
Segment #85  [00:02:29,920 --> 00:02:31,180] | Elapsed:  97.78s | Words: 7  | Text: 角色上的失误就是
Segment #86  [00:02:31,180 --> 00:02:32,780] | Elapsed:  97.78s | Words: 11 | Text: 徐焱子在商场店里去开店
Segment #87  [00:02:32,780 --> 00:02:33,700] | Elapsed:  97.78s | Words: 5  | Text: 当时我就感觉
Segment #88  [00:02:33,700 --> 00:02:34,720] | Elapsed:  97.78s | Words: 6  | Text: 这个东西很吸引
Segment #89  [00:02:35,620 --> 00:02:37,840] | Elapsed:  97.78s | Words: 11 | Text: 林怡当时一家商场店都没有
Segment #90  [00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:39,200] | Elapsed:  97.78s | Words: 8  | Text: 我感觉客人逛个街
Segment #91  [00:02:39,200 --> 00:02:40,040] | Elapsed:  97.78s | Words: 3  | Text: 车一停
Segment #92  [00:02:40,040 --> 00:02:41,020] | Elapsed:  97.78s | Words: 3  | Text: 街逛完了
Segment #93  [00:02:41,020 --> 00:02:41,680] | Elapsed:  97.78s | Words: 4  | Text: 车也洗好了
Segment #94  [00:02:42,220 --> 00:02:43,980] | Elapsed:  97.78s | Words: 11 | Text: 后来发现我喜欢的太简单了
Segment #95  [00:02:44,420 --> 00:02:45,640] | Elapsed:  97.78s | Words: 6  | Text: 开过店的人都知道
Segment #96  [00:02:45,640 --> 00:02:46,900] | Elapsed:  97.78s | Words: 4  | Text: 商场招商
Segment #97  [00:02:46,900 --> 00:02:48,640] | Elapsed:  97.78s | Words: 6  | Text: 其实它就是个装夹
Segment #98  [00:02:48,640 --> 00:02:49,480] | Elapsed: 115.23s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是个大装
Segment #99  [00:02:49,480 --> 00:02:51,840] | Elapsed: 115.23s | Words: 11 | Text: 你像我们平时看到的什么星巴克
Segment #100 [00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:54,040] | Elapsed: 115.23s | Words: 12 | Text: ACM 五一粮品 肯德基 温尔玛
Segment #101 [00:02:54,040 --> 00:02:55,040] | Elapsed: 115.23s | Words: 6  | Text: 这种大品牌店
Segment #102 [00:02:55,040 --> 00:02:57,260] | Elapsed: 115.23s | Words: 10 | Text: 就是被这个大装家邀请过来
Segment #103 [00:02:57,260 --> 00:02:58,160] | Elapsed: 115.23s | Words: 5  | Text: 联合做装的
Segment #104 [00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:01,000] | Elapsed: 115.23s | Words: 11 | Text: 我们的店铺是吃商场的流量
Segment #105 [00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:03,780] | Elapsed: 115.23s | Words: 11 | Text: 而这些店铺是能够给商场
Segment #106 [00:03:03,780 --> 00:03:04,880] | Elapsed: 115.23s | Words: 5  | Text: 带来流量的
Segment #107 [00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:07,160] | Elapsed: 115.23s | Words: 9  | Text: 所以商场通常会给予他们
Segment #108 [00:03:07,160 --> 00:03:09,680] | Elapsed: 115.23s | Words: 7  | Text: 很多的待遇免租期
Segment #109 [00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:10,740] | Elapsed: 115.23s | Words: 4  | Text: 装修补贴
Segment #110 [00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:12,960] | Elapsed: 115.23s | Words: 11 | Text: 搞定了这些大品牌店之后
Segment #111 [00:03:12,960 --> 00:03:14,140] | Elapsed: 115.23s | Words: 6  | Text: 自然就会有很多
Segment #112 [00:03:14,140 --> 00:03:15,320] | Elapsed: 115.23s | Words: 7  | Text: 像我们这种的散户
Segment #113 [00:03:15,320 --> 00:03:16,600] | Elapsed: 115.23s | Words: 8  | Text: 我们这种的杀了进场
Segment #114 [00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:18,200] | Elapsed: 132.96s | Words: 7  | Text: 这些机构和大户
Segment #115 [00:03:18,200 --> 00:03:19,300] | Elapsed: 132.96s | Words: 7  | Text: 占据了这个商场中
Segment #116 [00:03:19,300 --> 00:03:20,480] | Elapsed: 132.96s | Words: 6  | Text: 最好的流量入口
Segment #117 [00:03:20,480 --> 00:03:22,360] | Elapsed: 132.96s | Words: 9  | Text: 把商场的租金提上去
Segment #118 [00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:23,340] | Elapsed: 132.96s | Words: 6  | Text: 剩下的这些什么
Segment #119 [00:03:23,340 --> 00:03:24,120] | Elapsed: 132.96s | Words: 4  | Text: 小奶茶店
Segment #120 [00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:25,360] | Elapsed: 132.96s | Words: 7  | Text: 小餐饮店 服装店
Segment #121 [00:03:25,360 --> 00:03:26,300] | Elapsed: 132.96s | Words: 4  | Text: 就进场了
Segment #122 [00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:28,440] | Elapsed: 132.96s | Words: 10 | Text: 他们用远高于市场的价格
Segment #123 [00:03:28,440 --> 00:03:29,460] | Elapsed: 132.96s | Words: 6  | Text: 做着最累的活
Segment #124 [00:03:29,460 --> 00:03:31,240] | Elapsed: 132.96s | Words: 9  | Text: 开始了90一生的创业生活
Segment #125 [00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:33,340] | Elapsed: 132.96s | Words: 6  | Text: 对于装家来说
Segment #126 [00:03:33,340 --> 00:03:34,860] | Elapsed: 132.96s | Words: 7  | Text: 他们根本不会去关心
Segment #127 [00:03:34,860 --> 00:03:36,080] | Elapsed: 132.96s | Words: 8  | Text: 这些小品牌的死活
Segment #128 [00:03:36,080 --> 00:03:37,440] | Elapsed: 132.96s | Words: 5  | Text: 他们甚至还希望
Segment #129 [00:03:37,440 --> 00:03:38,400] | Elapsed: 132.96s | Words: 4  | Text: 这些小店
Segment #130 [00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:39,460] | Elapsed: 132.96s | Words: 4  | Text: 小品牌店
Segment #131 [00:03:39,460 --> 00:03:40,580] | Elapsed: 132.96s | Words: 4  | Text: 快点倒闭
Segment #132 [00:03:40,580 --> 00:03:41,500] | Elapsed: 132.96s | Words: 5  | Text: 因为你倒闭了
Segment #133 [00:03:41,500 --> 00:03:42,820] | Elapsed: 132.96s | Words: 9  | Text: 你的押金是不给你退的
Segment #134 [00:03:43,420 --> 00:03:44,340] | Elapsed: 132.96s | Words: 6  | Text: 我记得我当时
Segment #135 [00:03:44,340 --> 00:03:45,040] | Elapsed: 132.96s | Words: 5  | Text: 我交保证金
Segment #136 [00:03:45,040 --> 00:03:46,180] | Elapsed: 151.65s | Words: 8  | Text: 我交了两份保证金
Segment #137 [00:03:46,180 --> 00:03:47,440] | Elapsed: 151.65s | Words: 8  | Text: 一份叫铝约保证金
Segment #138 [00:03:47,440 --> 00:03:48,740] | Elapsed: 151.65s | Words: 8  | Text: 一份叫装修保证金
Segment #139 [00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:50,020] | Elapsed: 151.65s | Words: 4  | Text: 因为我的店铺
Segment #140 [00:03:50,020 --> 00:03:51,260] | Elapsed: 151.65s | Words: 9  | Text: 洗车店 汽车服务门店
Segment #141 [00:03:51,260 --> 00:03:52,200] | Elapsed: 151.65s | Words: 5  | Text: 是可以充卡的
Segment #142 [00:03:53,100 --> 00:03:54,040] | Elapsed: 151.65s | Words: 6  | Text: 铝约保证金就是
Segment #143 [00:03:54,040 --> 00:03:54,960] | Elapsed: 151.65s | Words: 5  | Text: 保证我的店铺
Segment #144 [00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:55,900] | Elapsed: 151.65s | Words: 5  | Text: 不会卷钱跑路
Segment #145 [00:03:55,900 --> 00:03:57,500] | Elapsed: 151.65s | Words: 6  | Text: 只有我宣布闭店
Segment #146 [00:03:58,040 --> 00:03:59,220] | Elapsed: 151.65s | Words: 7  | Text: 然后退场半年以后
Segment #147 [00:03:59,220 --> 00:03:59,760] | Elapsed: 151.65s | Words: 4  | Text: 它才会把
Segment #148 [00:03:59,760 --> 00:04:01,380] | Elapsed: 151.65s | Words: 8  | Text: 这个铝约保证金退给我
Segment #149 [00:04:01,700 --> 00:04:03,200] | Elapsed: 151.65s | Words: 10 | Text: 当时保证金我交了20万
Segment #150 [00:04:03,200 --> 00:04:04,280] | Elapsed: 151.65s | Words: 5  | Text: 这个我可以理解
Segment #151 [00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:06,700] | Elapsed: 151.65s | Words: 8  | Text: 这个操作我是可以理解的
Segment #152 [00:04:06,700 --> 00:04:07,720] | Elapsed: 151.65s | Words: 4  | Text: 但是有一个什么
Segment #153 [00:04:07,720 --> 00:04:08,320] | Elapsed: 151.65s | Words: 4  | Text: 我不能了解
Segment #154 [00:04:08,320 --> 00:04:09,340] | Elapsed: 151.65s | Words: 5  | Text: 装修保证金
Segment #155 [00:04:09,340 --> 00:04:10,180] | Elapsed: 151.65s | Words: 5  | Text: 我就交了5万
Segment #156 [00:04:10,180 --> 00:04:11,580] | Elapsed: 151.65s | Words: 6  | Text: 当时商场说的是
Segment #157 [00:04:11,580 --> 00:04:12,960] | Elapsed: 151.65s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是验收通过以后
Segment #158 [00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:14,300] | Elapsed: 167.02s | Words: 5  | Text: 没有破坏任何
Segment #159 [00:04:14,300 --> 00:04:15,300] | Elapsed: 167.02s | Words: 7  | Text: 场地的公共设施
Segment #160 [00:04:15,300 --> 00:04:15,900] | Elapsed: 167.02s | Words: 3  | Text: 就退给我
Segment #161 [00:04:16,680 --> 00:04:18,300] | Elapsed: 167.02s | Words: 7  | Text: 我交了5万 现在了
Segment #162 [00:04:20,520 --> 00:04:21,620] | Elapsed: 167.02s | Words: 5  | Text: 到现在都没退
Segment #163 [00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:24,740] | Elapsed: 167.02s | Words: 6  | Text: 关于就是商场店
Segment #164 [00:04:24,740 --> 00:04:25,640] | Elapsed: 167.02s | Words: 6  | Text: 运营的很多细节
Segment #165 [00:04:25,640 --> 00:04:26,860] | Elapsed: 167.02s | Words: 5  | Text: 感兴趣的朋友
Segment #166 [00:04:26,860 --> 00:04:27,500] | Elapsed: 167.02s | Words: 4  | Text: 可以点个赞
Segment #167 [00:04:27,500 --> 00:04:28,260] | Elapsed: 167.02s | Words: 2  | Text: 如果说
Segment #168 [00:04:28,260 --> 00:04:29,580] | Elapsed: 167.02s | Words: 7  | Text: 想要了解的朋友多
Segment #169 [00:04:29,580 --> 00:04:30,300] | Elapsed: 167.02s | Words: 5  | Text: 我可以专门的
Segment #170 [00:04:30,300 --> 00:04:31,080] | Elapsed: 167.02s | Words: 5  | Text: 出一集视频
Segment #171 [00:04:31,080 --> 00:04:31,600] | Elapsed: 167.02s | Words: 4  | Text: 去聊一聊
Segment #172 [00:04:32,960 --> 00:04:34,060] | Elapsed: 167.02s | Words: 3  | Text: 其实很多的
Segment #173 [00:04:34,060 --> 00:04:35,020] | Elapsed: 167.02s | Words: 3  | Text: 个体户
Segment #174 [00:04:35,020 --> 00:04:37,080] | Elapsed: 167.02s | Words: 7  | Text: 或者说小的实体店
Segment #175 [00:04:37,740 --> 00:04:39,640] | Elapsed: 167.02s | Words: 10 | Text: 在商场的博弈地位当中
Segment #176 [00:04:39,640 --> 00:04:41,060] | Elapsed: 167.02s | Words: 7  | Text: 基本上都是处于弱势
Segment #177 [00:04:41,060 --> 00:04:43,340] | Elapsed: 185.95s | Words: 8  | Text: 而商场在博弈当中
Segment #178 [00:04:43,340 --> 00:04:44,820] | Elapsed: 185.95s | Words: 8  | Text: 就像孙子兵法一样
Segment #179 [00:04:44,820 --> 00:04:45,660] | Elapsed: 185.95s | Words: 5  | Text: 是不败之地
Segment #180 [00:04:45,660 --> 00:04:46,700] | Elapsed: 185.95s | Words: 3  | Text: 365度
Segment #181 [00:04:46,700 --> 00:04:48,360] | Elapsed: 185.95s | Words: 10 | Text: 50角给你拿捏的死死的
Segment #182 [00:04:49,060 --> 00:04:50,340] | Elapsed: 185.95s | Words: 7  | Text: 如果你开过的实体店
Segment #183 [00:04:50,340 --> 00:04:50,940] | Elapsed: 185.95s | Words: 4  | Text: 你会发现
Segment #184 [00:04:50,940 --> 00:04:52,780] | Elapsed: 185.95s | Words: 10 | Text: 你跟房东签的租房合同
Segment #185 [00:04:53,180 --> 00:04:53,920] | Elapsed: 185.95s | Words: 3  | Text: 这就是一个
Segment #186 [00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:55,180] | Elapsed: 185.95s | Words: 9  | Text: 赤裸裸的不平等条约
Segment #187 [00:04:55,180 --> 00:04:57,040] | Elapsed: 185.95s | Words: 9  | Text: 你的一举一动都要经过
Segment #188 [00:04:57,040 --> 00:04:58,740] | Elapsed: 185.95s | Words: 9  | Text: 房东或者说商场的批准
Segment #189 [00:04:58,740 --> 00:04:59,420] | Elapsed: 185.95s | Words: 3  | Text: 才能干
Segment #190 [00:04:59,820 --> 00:05:01,140] | Elapsed: 185.95s | Words: 7  | Text: 你不经过他的同意
Segment #191 [00:05:01,140 --> 00:05:02,720] | Elapsed: 185.95s | Words: 10 | Text: 他随时有权力扣你的押金
Segment #192 [00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:04,040] | Elapsed: 185.95s | Words: 6  | Text: 你除了要支付
Segment #193 [00:05:04,040 --> 00:05:05,180] | Elapsed: 185.95s | Words: 7  | Text: 高额的押金以外
Segment #194 [00:05:05,180 --> 00:05:06,200] | Elapsed: 185.95s | Words: 6  | Text: 你中途比方说
Segment #195 [00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:07,260] | Elapsed: 185.95s | Words: 4  | Text: 举个例子
Segment #196 [00:05:07,260 --> 00:05:08,440] | Elapsed: 185.95s | Words: 8  | Text: 经营不善干不下去了
Segment #197 [00:05:08,440 --> 00:05:09,080] | Elapsed: 185.95s | Words: 4  | Text: 不想干了
Segment #198 [00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:09,800] | Elapsed: 185.95s | Words: 2  | Text: 对不起
Segment #199 [00:05:09,800 --> 00:05:11,800] | Elapsed: 204.47s | Words: 10 | Text: 房东不会给你推任何押金
Segment #200 [00:05:11,800 --> 00:05:14,180] | Elapsed: 204.47s | Words: 9  | Text: 反而还会要你伍约金
Segment #201 [00:05:14,180 --> 00:05:16,240] | Elapsed: 204.47s | Words: 10 | Text: 这就是导致了很多人想关店
Segment #202 [00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:17,020] | Elapsed: 204.47s | Words: 3  | Text: 我关不起
Segment #203 [00:05:17,680 --> 00:05:18,720] | Elapsed: 204.47s | Words: 5  | Text: 为什么因为一个商场
Segment #204 [00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:19,500] | Elapsed: 204.47s | Words: 6  | Text: 他有很多的店铺
Segment #205 [00:05:19,500 --> 00:05:20,080] | Elapsed: 204.47s | Words: 4  | Text: 你不想干
Segment #206 [00:05:20,080 --> 00:05:20,700] | Elapsed: 204.47s | Words: 3  | Text: 不干了
Segment #207 [00:05:20,700 --> 00:05:21,200] | Elapsed: 204.47s | Words: 4  | Text: 他不想干
Segment #208 [00:05:21,200 --> 00:05:21,780] | Elapsed: 204.47s | Words: 3  | Text: 不干了
Segment #209 [00:05:21,780 --> 00:05:22,800] | Elapsed: 204.47s | Words: 6  | Text: 我的商场还怎么干
Segment #210 [00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:23,900] | Elapsed: 204.47s | Words: 2  | Text: 对不对
Segment #211 [00:05:23,900 --> 00:05:24,940] | Elapsed: 204.47s | Words: 5  | Text: 这还不算完
Segment #212 [00:05:24,940 --> 00:05:26,240] | Elapsed: 204.47s | Words: 7  | Text: 商场还会要求你
Segment #213 [00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:27,300] | Elapsed: 204.47s | Words: 7  | Text: 把所有的装修恢复
Segment #214 [00:05:27,300 --> 00:05:27,800] | Elapsed: 204.47s | Words: 2  | Text: 谋批
Segment #215 [00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:28,780] | Elapsed: 204.47s | Words: 3  | Text: 这个恢复
Segment #216 [00:05:28,780 --> 00:05:29,940] | Elapsed: 204.47s | Words: 9  | Text: 又是一很大一笔费用
Segment #217 [00:05:29,940 --> 00:05:31,940] | Elapsed: 204.47s | Words: 8  | Text: 你的一切都被拿捏了
Segment #218 [00:05:32,820 --> 00:05:33,440] | Elapsed: 204.47s | Words: 3  | Text: 关键是
Segment #219 [00:05:33,440 --> 00:05:33,920] | Elapsed: 204.47s | Words: 1  | Text: 为什么
Segment #220 [00:05:34,300 --> 00:05:36,120] | Elapsed: 204.47s | Words: 9  | Text: 我们还会去愿意跟商场
Segment #221 [00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:37,320] | Elapsed: 204.47s | Words: 8  | Text: 或者说房东去签那种
Segment #222 [00:05:37,320 --> 00:05:38,320] | Elapsed: 204.47s | Words: 6  | Text: 不平等的条约
Segment #223 [00:05:38,320 --> 00:05:39,840] | Elapsed: 222.52s | Words: 8  | Text: 是因为你跟房东之间
Segment #224 [00:05:39,840 --> 00:05:41,440] | Elapsed: 222.52s | Words: 9  | Text: 是存在着巨大的信息差
Segment #225 [00:05:41,960 --> 00:05:42,880] | Elapsed: 222.52s | Words: 4  | Text: 信息不对称
Segment #226 [00:05:43,320 --> 00:05:44,160] | Elapsed: 222.52s | Words: 3  | Text: 一个商场
Segment #227 [00:05:44,160 --> 00:05:45,420] | Elapsed: 222.52s | Words: 8  | Text: 看比一个大型的集团
Segment #228 [00:05:45,420 --> 00:05:46,680] | Elapsed: 222.52s | Words: 7  | Text: 里边有很多的部门
Segment #229 [00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:48,340] | Elapsed: 222.52s | Words: 7  | Text: 什么市场部运营部
Segment #230 [00:05:48,340 --> 00:05:49,600] | Elapsed: 222.52s | Words: 6  | Text: 财务部保安部
Segment #231 [00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:50,300] | Elapsed: 222.52s | Words: 3  | Text: 物业部
Segment #232 [00:05:50,300 --> 00:05:51,220] | Elapsed: 222.52s | Words: 5  | Text: 还有个水电部
Segment #233 [00:05:51,220 --> 00:05:53,060] | Elapsed: 222.52s | Words: 9  | Text: 水电部它还分出来强电
Segment #234 [00:05:53,060 --> 00:05:54,960] | Elapsed: 222.52s | Words: 8  | Text: 就是强电部和弱电部
Segment #235 [00:05:54,960 --> 00:05:57,280] | Elapsed: 222.52s | Words: 11 | Text: 所以商场有专业的招商团队
Segment #236 [00:05:57,280 --> 00:05:59,180] | Elapsed: 222.52s | Words: 9  | Text: 这些招商部门的手中
Segment #237 [00:05:59,180 --> 00:06:00,600] | Elapsed: 222.52s | Words: 8  | Text: 会有很稳定的客户
Segment #238 [00:06:00,980 --> 00:06:02,400] | Elapsed: 222.52s | Words: 7  | Text: 他们会在同一时间里
Segment #239 [00:06:02,400 --> 00:06:03,360] | Elapsed: 222.52s | Words: 5  | Text: 给不同的人报价
Segment #240 [00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:05,140] | Elapsed: 222.52s | Words: 6  | Text: 而他们就是要集齐
Segment #241 [00:06:05,140 --> 00:06:06,500] | Elapsed: 222.52s | Words: 9  | Text: 这些潜在用户的精度
Segment #242 [00:06:06,500 --> 00:06:08,220] | Elapsed: 241.28s | Words: 9  | Text: 从而在博弈地位当中
Segment #243 [00:06:08,220 --> 00:06:09,420] | Elapsed: 241.28s | Words: 8  | Text: 取得最优势的地位
Segment #244 [00:06:09,420 --> 00:06:10,140] | Elapsed: 241.28s | Words: 3  | Text: 而你呢
Segment #245 [00:06:10,140 --> 00:06:12,060] | Elapsed: 241.28s | Words: 9  | Text: 只能通过商场大概的人流
Segment #246 [00:06:12,060 --> 00:06:13,420] | Elapsed: 241.28s | Words: 8  | Text: 和控制水平来揣摩
Segment #247 [00:06:13,420 --> 00:06:15,060] | Elapsed: 241.28s | Words: 9  | Text: 哎 这个商场到底能不能行事
Segment #248 [00:06:15,640 --> 00:06:16,980] | Elapsed: 241.28s | Words: 7  | Text: 由于你的经验匮乏
Segment #249 [00:06:16,980 --> 00:06:18,320] | Elapsed: 241.28s | Words: 5  | Text: 手里也没有很多
Segment #250 [00:06:18,320 --> 00:06:19,260] | Elapsed: 241.28s | Words: 7  | Text: 这种商场的资源
Segment #251 [00:06:19,620 --> 00:06:21,360] | Elapsed: 241.28s | Words: 10 | Text: 你对于商场的经验数据
Segment #252 [00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:22,400] | Elapsed: 241.28s | Words: 7  | Text: 只能拼感觉瞎猜
Segment #253 [00:06:22,400 --> 00:06:23,640] | Elapsed: 241.28s | Words: 4  | Text: 没事 我感觉
Segment #254 [00:06:23,640 --> 00:06:24,880] | Elapsed: 241.28s | Words: 8  | Text: 嗯 这商场人挺多行
Segment #255 [00:06:24,880 --> 00:06:25,340] | Elapsed: 241.28s | Words: 2  | Text: 可以干
Segment #256 [00:06:26,140 --> 00:06:28,000] | Elapsed: 241.28s | Words: 7  | Text: 商场的招商人员
Segment #257 [00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:29,060] | Elapsed: 241.28s | Words: 6  | Text: 才稍微忽悠你
Segment #258 [00:06:29,060 --> 00:06:29,860] | Elapsed: 241.28s | Words: 4  | Text: 哎呀 刘总
Segment #259 [00:06:29,860 --> 00:06:31,320] | Elapsed: 241.28s | Words: 4  | Text: 哎呀 张总
Segment #260 [00:06:31,320 --> 00:06:31,800] | Elapsed: 241.28s | Words: 1  | Text: 那个
Segment #261 [00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:33,120] | Elapsed: 241.28s | Words: 4  | Text: 你在不决定
Segment #262 [00:06:33,120 --> 00:06:34,220] | Elapsed: 241.28s | Words: 7  | Text: 这个一楼电梯口的
Segment #263 [00:06:34,220 --> 00:06:35,180] | Elapsed: 241.28s | Words: 6  | Text: 这个破子就没有了
Segment #264 [00:06:35,180 --> 00:06:36,520] | Elapsed: 258.39s | Words: 8  | Text: 剩下的都是位置不好的
Segment #265 [00:06:36,520 --> 00:06:36,960] | Elapsed: 258.39s | Words: 3  | Text: 没客流
Segment #266 [00:06:36,960 --> 00:06:38,160] | Elapsed: 258.39s | Words: 5  | Text: 你看 稍微一下乎
Segment #267 [00:06:38,160 --> 00:06:39,280] | Elapsed: 258.39s | Words: 6  | Text: 你就过过交钱了
Segment #268 [00:06:39,820 --> 00:06:40,140] | Elapsed: 258.39s | Words: 1  | Text: 所以呢
Segment #269 [00:06:40,140 --> 00:06:41,620] | Elapsed: 258.39s | Words: 6  | Text: 大部分没有资源的
Segment #270 [00:06:41,620 --> 00:06:43,140] | Elapsed: 258.39s | Words: 9  | Text: 创业者都是必败无疑的
Segment #271 [00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:45,520] | Elapsed: 258.39s | Words: 4  | Text: 看到这个视频
Segment #272 [00:06:45,520 --> 00:06:47,480] | Elapsed: 258.39s | Words: 6  | Text: 如果你干过商场店
Segment #273 [00:06:47,480 --> 00:06:49,100] | Elapsed: 258.39s | Words: 6  | Text: 你可以在评论区里
Segment #274 [00:06:49,100 --> 00:06:50,580] | Elapsed: 258.39s | Words: 3  | Text: 去分享一下
Segment #275 [00:06:50,580 --> 00:06:51,500] | Elapsed: 258.39s | Words: 5  | Text: 你的创业心得
Segment #276 [00:06:51,500 --> 00:06:52,200] | Elapsed: 258.39s | Words: 2  | Text: 我看看
Segment #277 [00:06:52,200 --> 00:06:53,640] | Elapsed: 258.39s | Words: 9  | Text: 到底有几个在商场店里
Segment #278 [00:06:53,640 --> 00:06:54,520] | Elapsed: 258.39s | Words: 6  | Text: 能赚到过钱的
Segment #279 [00:06:54,520 --> 00:06:55,540] | Elapsed: 258.39s | Words: 6  | Text: 你别说赚钱了
Segment #280 [00:06:56,080 --> 00:06:57,740] | Elapsed: 258.39s | Words: 7  | Text: 你的店铺存活周期
Segment #281 [00:06:57,740 --> 00:06:59,140] | Elapsed: 258.39s | Words: 8  | Text: 能有半年就不错了
Segment #282 [00:06:59,500 --> 00:07:00,220] | Elapsed: 258.39s | Words: 4  | Text: 你能开店
Segment #283 [00:07:00,220 --> 00:07:01,060] | Elapsed: 258.39s | Words: 5  | Text: 半年不倒闭
Segment #284 [00:07:01,060 --> 00:07:02,480] | Elapsed: 258.39s | Words: 9  | Text: 就已经是生命的奇迹了
Segment #285 [00:07:03,680 --> 00:07:04,240] | Elapsed: 258.39s | Words: 2  | Text: 看到这
Segment #286 [00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:05,760] | Elapsed: 276.00s | Words: 5  | Text: 你可能也会问
Segment #287 [00:07:06,160 --> 00:07:07,680] | Elapsed: 276.00s | Words: 8  | Text: 那既然创业的条件
Segment #288 [00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:09,000] | Elapsed: 276.00s | Words: 4  | Text: 如此的凶险
Segment #289 [00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:11,300] | Elapsed: 276.00s | Words: 8  | Text: 那如何从别人的装里
Segment #290 [00:07:11,300 --> 00:07:12,740] | Elapsed: 276.00s | Words: 9  | Text: 能够实现逆风翻盘呢
Segment #291 [00:07:13,140 --> 00:07:14,560] | Elapsed: 276.00s | Words: 7  | Text: 其实办法也很简单
Segment #292 [00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:15,500] | Elapsed: 276.00s | Words: 4  | Text: 你做不了大的
Segment #293 [00:07:15,500 --> 00:07:16,280] | Elapsed: 276.00s | Words: 4  | Text: 你就做小的
Segment #294 [00:07:16,280 --> 00:07:17,240] | Elapsed: 276.00s | Words: 5  | Text: 你做不了大装
Segment #295 [00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:18,020] | Elapsed: 276.00s | Words: 5  | Text: 你做个小装
Segment #296 [00:07:18,020 --> 00:07:20,920] | Elapsed: 276.00s | Words: 10 | Text: 也就是先做大装的服务商
Segment #297 [00:07:21,420 --> 00:07:22,760] | Elapsed: 276.00s | Words: 6  | Text: 慢慢的接待能量
Segment #298 [00:07:22,760 --> 00:07:24,000] | Elapsed: 276.00s | Words: 5  | Text: 换句话来说
Segment #299 [00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:24,740] | Elapsed: 276.00s | Words: 4  | Text: 就比方说
Segment #300 [00:07:24,740 --> 00:07:25,620] | Elapsed: 276.00s | Words: 5  | Text: 我们举个例子
Segment #301 [00:07:25,620 --> 00:07:26,140] | Elapsed: 276.00s | Words: 3  | Text: 去挖矿
Segment #302 [00:07:26,140 --> 00:07:26,940] | Elapsed: 276.00s | Words: 3  | Text: 挖矿山
Segment #303 [00:07:26,940 --> 00:07:27,280] | Elapsed: 276.00s | Words: 2  | Text: 挖矿
Segment #304 [00:07:27,280 --> 00:07:29,200] | Elapsed: 276.00s | Words: 10 | Text: 你既然没实力去开这个矿
Segment #305 [00:07:29,200 --> 00:07:29,760] | Elapsed: 276.00s | Words: 2  | Text: 你不行
Segment #306 [00:07:29,760 --> 00:07:31,120] | Elapsed: 276.00s | Words: 5  | Text: 你在矿山旁边
Segment #307 [00:07:31,120 --> 00:07:31,600] | Elapsed: 276.00s | Words: 3  | Text: 卖铲子
Segment #308 [00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:32,180] | Elapsed: 294.28s | Words: 4  | Text: 卖手套呗
Segment #309 [00:07:32,180 --> 00:07:32,440] | Elapsed: 294.28s | Words: 1  | Text: 是不是
Segment #310 [00:07:33,880 --> 00:07:34,640] | Elapsed: 294.28s | Words: 3  | Text: 我有一个朋友
Segment #311 [00:07:34,640 --> 00:07:35,940] | Elapsed: 294.28s | Words: 7  | Text: 以前也是跟着银座干
Segment #312 [00:07:35,940 --> 00:07:37,360] | Elapsed: 294.28s | Words: 7  | Text: 现在也很满不满了
Segment #313 [00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:39,280] | Elapsed: 294.28s | Words: 10 | Text: 他是指定的消防卫网单位
Segment #314 [00:07:39,280 --> 00:07:40,620] | Elapsed: 294.28s | Words: 7  | Text: 所有商户经常装修
Segment #315 [00:07:40,620 --> 00:07:41,920] | Elapsed: 294.28s | Words: 6  | Text: 最后一验收的时候
Segment #316 [00:07:41,920 --> 00:07:42,940] | Elapsed: 294.28s | Words: 4  | Text: 他说了算
Segment #317 [00:07:43,400 --> 00:07:44,580] | Elapsed: 294.29s | Words: 6  | Text: 同时还承包了
Segment #318 [00:07:44,580 --> 00:07:45,960] | Elapsed: 294.29s | Words: 7  | Text: 厂内所有的广告位
Segment #319 [00:07:45,960 --> 00:07:47,320] | Elapsed: 294.29s | Words: 6  | Text: 他可能他整体的
Segment #320 [00:07:47,960 --> 00:07:49,180] | Elapsed: 294.29s | Words: 8  | Text: 承包费也就几十万
Segment #321 [00:07:49,180 --> 00:07:50,220] | Elapsed: 294.29s | Words: 2  | Text: 但是一个
Segment #322 [00:07:50,940 --> 00:07:51,820] | Elapsed: 294.29s | Words: 3  | Text: 好的牌子
Segment #323 [00:07:51,820 --> 00:07:52,940] | Elapsed: 294.29s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是位置好的广告牌
Segment #324 [00:07:52,940 --> 00:07:53,640] | Elapsed: 294.29s | Words: 4  | Text: 对于那些
Segment #325 [00:07:53,640 --> 00:07:54,460] | Elapsed: 294.29s | Words: 3  | Text: 4S店
Segment #326 [00:07:54,460 --> 00:07:55,540] | Elapsed: 294.29s | Words: 7  | Text: 或者说本地开发商
Segment #327 [00:07:55,540 --> 00:07:56,560] | Elapsed: 294.29s | Words: 6  | Text: 做楼盘宣传的
Segment #328 [00:07:56,560 --> 00:07:57,520] | Elapsed: 294.29s | Words: 6  | Text: 他可能一块牌子
Segment #329 [00:07:57,520 --> 00:07:58,320] | Elapsed: 294.29s | Words: 7  | Text: 他就收了十几万
Segment #330 [00:07:59,460 --> 00:07:59,920] | Elapsed: 294.29s | Words: 2  | Text: 所以说
Segment #331 [00:07:59,920 --> 00:08:00,800] | Elapsed: 312.58s | Words: 5  | Text: 那总结一下吧
Segment #332 [00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:02,700] | Elapsed: 312.58s | Words: 9  | Text: 做装思维就是博弈思维
Segment #333 [00:08:02,700 --> 00:08:04,000] | Elapsed: 312.58s | Words: 6  | Text: 谁有求于别人
Segment #334 [00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:04,900] | Elapsed: 312.58s | Words: 6  | Text: 谁在博弈当中
Segment #335 [00:08:04,900 --> 00:08:05,940] | Elapsed: 312.58s | Words: 7  | Text: 就处于被动地位
Segment #336 [00:08:06,700 --> 00:08:07,860] | Elapsed: 312.58s | Words: 6  | Text: 其实人在一辈子
Segment #337 [00:08:07,860 --> 00:08:08,580] | Elapsed: 312.58s | Words: 3  | Text: 机会很多
Segment #338 [00:08:08,580 --> 00:08:09,400] | Elapsed: 312.58s | Words: 3  | Text: 大部分的人
Segment #339 [00:08:09,400 --> 00:08:10,800] | Elapsed: 312.58s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是那梭哈了几次
Segment #340 [00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:11,700] | Elapsed: 312.58s | Words: 5  | Text: 然后一败徒弟
Segment #341 [00:08:11,700 --> 00:08:13,600] | Elapsed: 312.58s | Words: 7  | Text: 这就导致了后面
Segment #342 [00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:14,680] | Elapsed: 312.58s | Words: 5  | Text: 很难翻身了
Segment #343 [00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:15,740] | Elapsed: 312.58s | Words: 4  | Text: 那些总喜欢
Segment #344 [00:08:15,740 --> 00:08:17,420] | Elapsed: 312.58s | Words: 7  | Text: 梭哈极限操作的人
Segment #345 [00:08:17,420 --> 00:08:18,500] | Elapsed: 312.58s | Words: 5  | Text: 总是以为自己
Segment #346 [00:08:18,500 --> 00:08:19,520] | Elapsed: 312.58s | Words: 5  | Text: 每次都能够
Segment #347 [00:08:19,520 --> 00:08:20,380] | Elapsed: 312.58s | Words: 4  | Text: 逃出生天
Segment #348 [00:08:20,380 --> 00:08:21,260] | Elapsed: 312.58s | Words: 5  | Text: 创造奇迹的人
Segment #349 [00:08:21,260 --> 00:08:23,100] | Elapsed: 312.58s | Words: 8  | Text: 这真的是对于大数法子
Segment #350 [00:08:23,100 --> 00:08:25,200] | Elapsed: 312.58s | Words: 9  | Text: 和客观规律的不敬畏
Segment #351 [00:08:25,200 --> 00:08:26,520] | Elapsed: 312.58s | Words: 5  | Text: 创业从某种
Segment #352 [00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:28,120] | Elapsed: 312.58s | Words: 6  | Text: 意义上来讲吧
Segment #353 [00:08:28,480 --> 00:08:29,260] | Elapsed: 328.74s | Words: 3  | Text: 就是一门
Segment #354 [00:08:29,260 --> 00:08:30,400] | Elapsed: 328.74s | Words: 6  | Text: 在有限资源内
Segment #355 [00:08:30,400 --> 00:08:31,980] | Elapsed: 328.74s | Words: 10 | Text: 找到最好答案的运筹学
Segment #356 [00:08:31,980 --> 00:08:33,320] | Elapsed: 328.74s | Words: 6  | Text: 不是我擅长的事
Segment #357 [00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:33,860] | Elapsed: 328.74s | Words: 2  | Text: 我不干
Segment #358 [00:08:33,860 --> 00:08:35,640] | Elapsed: 328.74s | Words: 6  | Text: 不是我做装的事
Segment #359 [00:08:35,640 --> 00:08:36,240] | Elapsed: 328.74s | Words: 2  | Text: 我不干
Segment #360 [00:08:36,240 --> 00:08:38,100] | Elapsed: 328.74s | Words: 7  | Text: 因为成功率太低了
Segment #361 [00:08:38,100 --> 00:08:39,460] | Elapsed: 328.74s | Words: 4  | Text: 一旦失败
Segment #362 [00:08:39,460 --> 00:08:40,080] | Elapsed: 328.74s | Words: 4  | Text: 就会付出
Segment #363 [00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:42,560] | Elapsed: 328.74s | Words: 11 | Text: 巨大的沉默成本和机会成本
Segment #364 [00:08:42,980 --> 00:08:44,060] | Elapsed: 328.74s | Words: 6  | Text: 关于沉默成本
Segment #365 [00:08:44,060 --> 00:08:45,480] | Elapsed: 328.74s | Words: 8  | Text: 如果说有感兴趣的朋友
Segment #366 [00:08:45,480 --> 00:08:46,760] | Elapsed: 328.74s | Words: 6  | Text: 我可以再发一期
Segment #367 [00:08:46,760 --> 00:08:48,120] | Elapsed: 328.74s | Words: 3  | Text: 上一期
Segment #368 [00:08:48,780 --> 00:08:51,260] | Elapsed: 328.74s | Words: 9  | Text: 字幕不合适被下架了
Segment #369 [00:08:51,260 --> 00:08:51,920] | Elapsed: 328.74s | Words: 4  | Text: 这期视频
Segment #370 [00:08:51,920 --> 00:08:52,860] | Elapsed: 328.74s | Words: 4  | Text: 也可以建议你们
Segment #371 [00:08:52,860 --> 00:08:53,840] | Elapsed: 328.74s | Words: 6  | Text: 点赞收藏慢慢看
Segment #372 [00:08:55,160 --> 00:08:56,440] | Elapsed: 328.74s | Words: 7  | Text: 孙子兵法都说了
Segment #373 [00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:57,740] | Elapsed: 346.07s | Words: 5  | Text: 惜之善战者
Segment #374 [00:08:57,740 --> 00:08:58,720] | Elapsed: 346.07s | Words: 5  | Text: 先为不可胜
Segment #375 [00:08:58,720 --> 00:09:00,080] | Elapsed: 346.07s | Words: 6  | Text: 以待敌之可胜
Segment #376 [00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:01,120] | Elapsed: 346.07s | Words: 4  | Text: 孙子兵法
Segment #377 [00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:02,160] | Elapsed: 346.07s | Words: 6  | Text: 主要思想是什么
Segment #378 [00:09:02,160 --> 00:09:03,820] | Elapsed: 346.07s | Words: 7  | Text: 不是教你以若胜强
Segment #379 [00:09:03,820 --> 00:09:04,600] | Elapsed: 346.07s | Words: 4  | Text: 以少胜多
Segment #380 [00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:05,600] | Elapsed: 346.07s | Words: 4  | Text: 而是教你
Segment #381 [00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:06,120] | Elapsed: 346.07s | Words: 2  | Text: 不占
Segment #382 [00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:07,080] | Elapsed: 346.07s | Words: 2  | Text: 不败
Segment #383 [00:09:07,080 --> 00:09:07,720] | Elapsed: 346.07s | Words: 2  | Text: 不忙
Segment #384 [00:09:07,720 --> 00:09:08,700] | Elapsed: 346.07s | Words: 4  | Text: 就说少干
Segment #385 [00:09:08,700 --> 00:09:10,320] | Elapsed: 346.07s | Words: 9  | Text: 或者说不干低胜率的事
Segment #386 [00:09:11,400 --> 00:09:12,540] | Elapsed: 346.07s | Words: 7  | Text: 你可能看完这个视频
Segment #387 [00:09:12,540 --> 00:09:13,440] | Elapsed: 346.07s | Words: 6  | Text: 会游融的干开
Segment #388 [00:09:13,440 --> 00:09:13,660] | Elapsed: 346.07s | Words: 1  | Text: 哎
Segment #389 [00:09:13,660 --> 00:09:14,460] | Elapsed: 346.07s | Words: 3  | Text: 古人城
Segment #390 [00:09:14,460 --> 00:09:15,240] | Elapsed: 346.07s | Words: 3  | Text: 不欺我
Segment #391 [00:09:16,560 --> 00:09:17,200] | Elapsed: 346.07s | Words: 3  | Text: 看到这儿
Segment #392 [00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:17,740] | Elapsed: 346.07s | Words: 5  | Text: 还是愣着干什么
Segment #393 [00:09:17,740 --> 00:09:18,400] | Elapsed: 346.07s | Words: 4  | Text: 点赞关注
Segment #394 [00:09:18,400 --> 00:09:19,220] | Elapsed: 346.07s | Words: 4  | Text: 我们多读书
Segment #395 [00:09:19,220 --> 00:09:20,480] | Elapsed: 346.07s | Words: 5  | Text: 每天多进步
Segment #396 [00:09:21,360 --> 00:09:22,220] | Elapsed: 346.07s | Words: 4  | Text: 加油孟丞人
Segment #397 [00:09:22,220 --> 00:09:23,060] | Elapsed: 346.07s | Words: 6  | Text: 祝你越来越好
